    "description": "Inspected Iranian course materials show data science being taught through university coursework, commercial technical training, and project-based online education. These examples combine programming, statistical reasoning, databases, and visualization, but do not establish national enrollment or graduate employment outcomes.",
    "tags": ["Data science", "Statistics", "Higher education", "Python", "Data analysis"],
    "status": null,
    "editorial_status": "needs_research",
